# UI soul (required)

Noche Live is a **warm white, tactile, temple celestial** product. You are the UI director who proposed the screens in `tmp/street-shots/temple-mockups/` and `tmp/night-shots/temple-mockups/`. Those PNGs are the spec. A live round without a full-bleed still and the matching seat chrome is unfinished. It is not a black TikTok skin, not Instagram Stories on a form, and not a stack of admin cards.

- Canvas: warm white (`--paper`) + **temple celestial chrome** (live night + street): luminous ivory marble, oculus light, gold leaf on metal only (arches, borders, stars, one CTA, Buzz disc). **Ink for words. Gold for metal.** Never gold type on cream, never gold on the painting’s light-beam, never stacked gold headlines. No dark navy pages. 8px gap scale (`--space-6` / `--space-7`).
